ine/godot/issues/comments/2928172803","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103794#issuecomment-2928172803","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103794","id":2928172803,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uiF8D","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T00:09:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T00:09:20Z","body":"> Will this change be considered for cherry-pick to 4.4? It applies cleanly against 4.4.1-stable and fixes a crash on M1 mac and Intel integrated gpu on linux.\r\n\r\nYa, I think that should be fine. We don't usually cherry pick pure performance enhancements, but if this fixes a crash, then it makes sense. The code is well-tested by now, so it should be totally safe too","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2928172803/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]